Send out a claw of fire, striking in a line doing [17, 23, 27, 31, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage leading to a target. The target is caught in the claw's grasp, taking [98%, 112%, 122%, 131%, 139% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as fire damage and becoming unable to move for [2, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns, while also taking [17, 23, 27, 31, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage per turn.

Starting from talent level 4, it will also silence.

The beam damage and damage over time will increase with your Spellpower.
